pes have the same parameters but in different orders the `TYPE_UUID` will be the same. \n```rust \n#[derive(TypeUuid)]\nstruct Foo<T, U>;\nassert_ne!(Foo::<T, U>::TYPE_UUID, Foo::<U, T>::TYPE_UUID); // fails\n```\n\n## What went wrong\n\n- Expected different `TYPE_UUID`'s but they are the same. \n- This is due to the fact the `TYPE_UUID`'s are the XOR of the params' types, and so even if they are XOR'd in different orders the result will be the same.\n\n## Additional Information\n- can be fixed by #6633","closed_by":{"login":"bors[bot]","id":26634292,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90MjY2MzQyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/bors","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/6680/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/6680/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}